      <h3 class="Cite" id="10.50.110.060"><a name="10.50.110.060">10-50.110.060</a> Single-Family House</h3>
      <table class="NoRules" style="margin-left: 0.0pt; margin-top: 6.0pt; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; width: 470.2768pt" cellspacing="0" summary="">
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 240.0pt">
                        <p class="CellBody"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-50.110.060a1.272126.jpg" width="316" height="208"  alt="" title="" /></p>

                        <p class="CellBody"><span class="italic">Existing single-family house with porch frontage type and detailed elements, such as the bay window, rake and eaves, and windows.</span></p>

          </td>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 8.389pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top; width: 221.8878pt" rowspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBody"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-50.110.060a_drawing.272126.jpg" width="291" height="269"  alt="" title="" /></p>

                        <p class="CellBody"><span class="italic">General Note: The drawings and photos on this page are illustrative, not regulatory.</span></p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top" rowspan="3">
                        <p class="CellBody"><img class="Default" src="../images/10-50.110.060a2.272126.jpg" width="318" height="208"  alt="" title="" /></p>

                        <p class="CellBody"><span class="italic">Existing single-family estate in Flagstaff.</span></p>

          </td>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="background-color: #B2B2B2;border: 1px solid black; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyBold"><span class="bold">A. Description</span></p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top" rowspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBody">The single-family house building type is a medium-sized detached structure on a medium-sized lot that incorporates one unit. It is typically located within a primarily single-family residential neighborhood in a walkable urban setting, potentially near a neighborhood main street.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
